      "independent_solution": "Use the frozen ordered values: base 2 gives (3,5,-2,0,-1) for (8,32,1/4,1,0.5); base 3 gives (1,4,-3,0,-5) for (3,81,1/27,1,1/243). Check both rows of every option, not just one discriminating cell.",
