      "status": "PASS",
      "independent_solution": "The frozen eight-value vector is (2,-2,-2,6,-2,-1/4,-6,-2). Its defining powers are 2^2 = 4; 3^(-2) = 1/9; 10^(-2) = 0.01; (sqrt(2))^6 = 8; (1/5)^(-2) = 25; 16^(-1/4) = 1/2; (1/sqrt(3))^(-6) = 27; (0.4)^(-2) = 6.25.",
