      "independent_solution": "Reuse the frozen source relation: f is the closed ray y = 2x + 3 for x >= 0, with domain [0,+infinity) and range [3,+infinity). Exchanging coordinates gives the closed ray g with x = 2y + 3, equivalently y = (x-3)/2 for x >= 3; its domain is [3,+infinity), range [0,+infinity). Independently compare each visible graph to all claims in its option; an internally coherent different graph is not the required f or g.",
